      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WADE'S EDGE (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing eighth (23.66) in a Grade 5 at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to his credit. Looks the one to beat on his best form. MR. SPECKLE (1) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at Gosford over 388m. Goes well out of this box with a win and two minor placings. Can measure up. FLYING STRATUS (8) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from five starts. Below best last time at Wentworth Park (30.47) in a Grade 5, finishing a 7 length sixth. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. KICKER ZOOM (5) collected a minor prize last start over this track and distance - must be considered.",
